        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Comfy LTX-2.5- FLF2V\n\nGenerate a video from first and last frame reference images using LTX-2.5, blending both frames into a single animated sequence. Ideal for creating transition shots, morphing between two subjects or scenes, and building multi-shot narratives from still references. Runs on Comfy Cloud and needs a COMFY_API_KEY.\n\n**How it works:** The Comfy nodes form the complete template graph. Run submits the graph to Comfy Cloud and saves its outputs.\n\n**Try this:** Change the prompt or the Load node inputs and run again to compare results.\n\nSource: https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/blob/1ae390968e323dba24a6991d1860ded051f5a79b/templates/video_ltx2_5_flf2v.json (MIT). Model licenses apply separately."
